 Mặt khác, ta có $\widehat{KOF}+\widehat{QOF}=180^{\circ}$, suy ra 

$\widehat{QOF}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{KOF}=180^{\circ}-34^{\circ}=146^{\circ}$.

Vậy sđ$\stackrel\frown{QF}=\widehat{QOF}=146^{\circ}$. 
 }\end{ex}

